{"repositoryId":1416136262,"availability":"available","full":"MaxonT/TRACES.md","name":"TRACES.md","description":"TRACES.md — AGENTS.md, but for what agents did. A simple, open format for recording what AI agents did, for error analysis and self-optimization.","category":"Productivity","language":"Python","stars":3,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-12T21:13:33Z","updated":"2026-10-14T21:54:29Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://maxont.github.io/TRACES.md/","topics":["agent-traces","agentic-ai","agents-md","ai","ai-agents","andrew-ng","claude-code","cli","codex","coding-agents","error-analysis","llm","markdown","mcp","mit-license","observability","open-standard","python","specification","traces"],"demo":"https://maxont.github.io/TRACES.md/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T02:46:20.438Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-19T02:46:20.438Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-19T02:46:20.438Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-12T23:51:41.210Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-19T02:46:20.438Z","stars":3,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["TRACES.md is a simple, open format for recording what AI agents did. AGENTS.md, but for what agents did.","Think of TRACES.md as a flight recorder for agents: a dedicated, predictable place where every tool call, command and result is written down, objectively, failures included, so errors can be analyzed and agents can improve. AGENTS.md tells an agent how to behave; TRACES.md records what it actually did.","Note. A trace is one plain, append-only file per task, one line per operation, each saying when, which tool, what it did, and how it ended. The record is objective (no reasoning, no story) and honest (failures are recorded). You cannot improve what you cannot replay."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/MaxonT/TRACES.md/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"fc51b10c34d363205fc83ac9e35d5ec61a4b704aa22a29dbd75c5cb1317a90d7","extractedAt":"2026-10-